A student is picked at random from the debating team. Given that the student is female, what is the probability the student is a junior?

solutions.latex:
The ratio $1:2:3$ gives selection probabilities $\dfrac{1}{6}$, $\dfrac{2}{6}=\dfrac{1}{3}$ and $\dfrac{3}{6}=\dfrac{1}{2}$.

\exfigure{1630_q19_s1}
